Note on data licensing / 数据授权说明

This license covers the source code and documentation in this repository only.
It does NOT cover the underlying survey data, which is not distributed here.

  * Nationscape (UCLA / Democracy Fund Voter Study Group) is subject to its own
    terms of use and requires a request form.
  * IPUMS USA (University of Minnesota) is registered-user licensed data and its
    terms do not permit redistribution.

To reproduce the results, obtain both datasets yourself following the steps in
README.md ("数据来源").
